  1  Remove 6 images                                                                                     IRREVERSIBLE
     $ podman rmi 3f9a1c07be52 9e04d7aa1f30 c81f2e4d9a07 0b7de5c3f812 e5a2190bd4c6 a1b2c3d4e5f6
