  3  Tell your Mac which blocks are free                                                                         SAFE
     $ podman machine ssh -- sudo fstrim -av
     Only works while the machine runs — so it goes before stopping.

  4  Stop the machine                                                                                      REVERSIBLE
     $ podman machine stop
     Can be turned off below. api-dev and db-dev will stop too.

  5  Check the result                                                                                       READ-ONLY
     $ du -h ~/.local/share/containers/podman/machine/applehv/podman-machine-default-arm64.raw
     Compare size on disk before and after.


